{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21371","headline":"见人咏韩舍人新律诗因有戏赠 · 元稹","name":"见人咏韩舍人新律诗因有戏赠","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"喜闻韩古调，兼爱近诗篇。\n玉磬声声彻，金铃个个圆。\n高疎明月下，细腻早春前。\n花态繁於绮，闺情软似绵。\n轻新便妓唱，凝妙入僧禅。\n欲得人人伏，能教面面全。\n延之苦拘检，摩诘好因缘。\n七字排居敬，千词敌乐天。\n殷勤闲太祝，好去老通川。\n莫漫裁章句，须饶紫禁仙。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"元稹","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_21371.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_21371","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}